notes.content:
Dear Friends,

After the first 12 hours of the game's release we decided to add your requests and corrections to the game.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37570178/16012f1a1aeb150ff80d4c922af935aa2462be00.png

Update 1.0.0.4
- Added an Active Pause under “SPACE” button. Players can stop the game at any point now and give orders to their employees without worrying about the auctions at the same time;
- Saving and Loading the game is now available;
- Added an info box where the game will ask you if you want to start tutorial first after you press 
"NEW GAME" on the first launch;
- The Exit button in main menu is now lighting up once in a while to help players with it’s location;
- Added a confirmation window when player is trying to exit the game;
- Changed the ratio system of Positive, Neutral and Negative events - You will no longer meet as many negative events as before;
- Increased the value of Nisson Rogue and Infinity G37x;
- Changed User Interface of Settings;


Remember that we create a game for you, that's why we want you to share your opinions with us. Also remember to leave us reviews after playing the game, because it motivates our whole team very much.

Best regards
Car Trader Simulator team

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1296280/Car_Trader_Simulator__Welcome_to_the_Business/

